<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1450759792"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1494664834"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="じゃぱにーずTOKYOガール (feat. Hanon &amp; Kotoha)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="HoneyWorks / Hanon / Kotoha"/><amll:meta key="album" value="恋色同盟"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:27.249"><div begin="00:00.483" end="04:27.249"><p begin="00:00.483" end="00:04.063" itunes:key="L1">じゃぱにーずTOKYO カラフルスイーツ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以下歌词翻译由文曲大模型提供</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">he n kyo ku ： HoneyWorks</span></p><p begin="00:04.064" end="00:07.715" itunes:key="L2">じゃぱにーずTOKYO トキメイテ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">日本风Tokyo 心跳加速</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ja pa ni i zu Tokyo to ki me i te</span></p><p begin="00:07.716" end="00:10.900" itunes:key="L3">じゃぱにーずTOKYO 恋に落ちて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">日本风Tokyo 坠入爱河</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ja pa ni i zu Tokyo ko i ni o chi te</span></p><p begin="00:10.901" end="00:15.640" itunes:key="L4">きっときっとずっとこの場所で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝对绝对要永远在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to ki 't to zu 't to ko no ba sho de</span></p><p begin="00:29.537" end="00:33.280" itunes:key="L5">眩しい世界憧れて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向往着耀眼的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma bu shi i se ka i a ko ga re te</span></p><p begin="00:33.281" end="00:36.870" itunes:key="L6">緑の森抜け出した<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逃离翠绿的森林</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi do ri no mo ri nu ke da shi ta</span></p><p begin="00:36.871" end="00:39.886" itunes:key="L7">眠らない不思議な街<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这不眠的神奇都市</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne mu ra na i fu shi gi na ma chi</span></p><p begin="00:39.887" end="00:43.051" itunes:key="L8">ねえ眠くないの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喂你不会困吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e ne mu ku na i no ？</span></p><p begin="00:44.027" end="00:47.796" itunes:key="L9">星たちは隠れたまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">繁星依旧藏匿身影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho shi ta chi ha ka ku re ta ma ma</span></p><p begin="00:47.797" end="00:51.441" itunes:key="L10">チカチカ急かすブルーライト<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">蓝光信号不断催促</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi ka chi ka se ka su bu ru u ra i to</span></p><p begin="00:51.442" end="00:54.553" itunes:key="L11">リズムを刻む足音<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">踏着节奏的脚步声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri zu mu wo ki za mu a shi o to</span></p><p begin="00:54.554" end="00:57.478" itunes:key="L12">ここは遊園地<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这里是游乐园</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ha yu u e n chi</span></p><p begin="00:58.111" end="01:02.050" itunes:key="L13">目が回るジェットコースター<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令人目眩的过山车</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me ga ma wa ru je 't to ko o su ta a</span></p><p begin="01:02.051" end="01:05.469" itunes:key="L14">振り落とされないように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了不被甩落抓紧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri o to sa re na i yo u ni</span></p><p begin="01:05.470" end="01:11.344" itunes:key="L15">最高に上げていこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们尽情尖叫吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i ko u ni a ge te i ko u</span></p><p begin="01:12.656" end="01:16.127" itunes:key="L16">じゃぱにーずTOKYOガール夢を持って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">日本风Tokyo女孩怀抱梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ja pa ni i zu Tokyo ga a ru yu me wo mo 't te</span></p><p begin="01:16.128" end="01:19.851" itunes:key="L17">らららPRETTYガールほら笑って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦 漂亮女孩快绽放笑容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ra ra ra pretty ga a ru ho ra wa ra 't te</span></p><p begin="01:19.852" end="01:23.610" itunes:key="L18">かませFIGHTINGガール胸を張って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">加油啊 战斗女孩挺起胸膛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ma se fighting ga a ru mu ne wo ha 't te</span></p><p begin="01:23.611" end="01:27.683" itunes:key="L19">甘い甘いチョコレート食べて？(よし！)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要尝尝甜甜的巧克力吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ma i a ma i cho ko re e to ta be te ？</span></p><p begin="01:27.684" end="01:30.655" itunes:key="L20">TOKYOガール芽を出して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(好)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( yo shi )</span></p><p begin="01:30.656" end="01:34.475" itunes:key="L21">らららPRETTYに花咲かせよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦 让美丽花朵绽放吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ra ra ra pretty ni ha na sa ka se yo u</span></p><p begin="01:34.476" end="01:37.960" itunes:key="L22">かませFIGHTINGガール自信もって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">加油啊 战斗女孩充满自信</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ma se fighting ga a ru ji shi n mo 't te</span></p><p begin="01:37.961" end="01:43.396" itunes:key="L23">生きて生きて生きてこの場所で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">活着活着活着就在此处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki te i ki te i ki te ko no ba sho de</span></p><p begin="01:56.847" end="02:00.696" itunes:key="L24">住み慣れて来たこの街で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这生活已久的街道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su mi na re te ki ta ko no ma chi de</span></p><p begin="02:00.697" end="02:04.144" itunes:key="L25">うまくいかない時だって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使遇到不顺心时刻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma ku i ka na i to ki da 't te</span></p><p begin="02:04.145" end="02:07.344" itunes:key="L26">虹を辿ればその先に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要沿着彩虹追寻前方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ji wo ta do re ba so no sa ki ni</span></p><p begin="02:07.345" end="02:10.715" itunes:key="L27">きっと君がいる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你定会在那里等候</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to ki mi ga i ru</span></p><p begin="02:11.361" end="02:15.060" itunes:key="L28">同じお月様を見て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">凝望同一轮明月</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o na ji o tsu ki sa ma wo mi te</span></p><p begin="02:15.061" end="02:18.724" itunes:key="L29">眠れない夜を超えた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跨越无眠之夜后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne mu re na i yo ru wo ko e ta</span></p><p begin="02:18.725" end="02:21.745" itunes:key="L30">いつかこの遊園地を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总想让你也看看</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka ko no yu u e n chi wo</span></p><p begin="02:21.746" end="02:24.546" itunes:key="L31">君にも見せたいな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这座梦幻游乐园啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ni mo mi se ta i na</span></p><p begin="02:25.393" end="02:29.338" itunes:key="L32">目が回るメリーゴーランド<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令人目眩的旋转木马</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me ga ma wa ru me ri i go o ra n do</span></p><p begin="02:29.339" end="02:32.670" itunes:key="L33">振り落とされないように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了不被甩落抓紧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri o to sa re na i yo u ni</span></p><p begin="02:32.671" end="02:38.685" itunes:key="L34">最高に上げていこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们尽情尖叫吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i ko u ni a ge te i ko u</span></p><p begin="02:39.712" end="02:43.491" itunes:key="L35">じゃぱにーずTOKYOガール夢を持って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">日本风Tokyo女孩怀抱梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ja pa ni i zu Tokyo ga a ru yu me wo mo 't te</span></p><p begin="02:43.492" end="02:47.119" itunes:key="L36">らららLONELYガール時に泣いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦 孤独女孩偶尔哭泣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ra ra ra lonely ga a ru to ki ni na i te</span></p><p begin="02:47.120" end="02:50.752" itunes:key="L37">かませONLYガール胸を張って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">加油啊 唯一女孩挺起胸膛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ma se only ga a ru mu ne wo ha 't te</span></p><p begin="02:50.753" end="02:55.112" itunes:key="L38">甘い甘いチョコレート食べて？(よし！)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要尝尝甜甜的巧克力吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ma i a ma i cho ko re e to ta be te ？</span></p><p begin="02:55.113" end="02:57.957" itunes:key="L39">TOKYOガールその先へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(好)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Tokyo ga a ru so no sa ki he</span></p><p begin="02:57.958" end="03:01.666" itunes:key="L40">らららHAPPYな花咲かせよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦 让幸福花朵绽放吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ra ra ra happy na ha na sa ka se yo u</span></p><p begin="03:01.667" end="03:05.357" itunes:key="L41">かませFIGHTINGガール自信もって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">加油啊 战斗女孩充满自信</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ma se fighting ga a ru ji shi n mo 't te</span></p><p begin="03:05.358" end="03:10.900" itunes:key="L42">走れ走れ走れ届くまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔跑奔跑奔跑直到抵达</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha shi re ha shi re ha shi re to do ku ma de</span></p><p begin="03:23.590" end="03:27.599" itunes:key="L43">目が回るジェットコースター<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令人目眩的过山车</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me ga ma wa ru je 't to ko o su ta a</span></p><p begin="03:27.600" end="03:30.821" itunes:key="L44">振り落とされないように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了不被甩落抓紧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri o to sa re na i yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:30.822" end="03:37.398" itunes:key="L45">最高に上げていこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们尽情尖叫吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i ko u ni a ge te i ko u</span></p><p begin="03:38.165" end="03:41.635" itunes:key="L46">じゃぱにーずTOKYOガール夢を持って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">日本风Tokyo女孩怀抱梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ja pa ni i zu Tokyo ga a ru yu me wo mo 't te</span></p><p begin="03:41.636" end="03:45.322" itunes:key="L47">らららPRETTYガールほら笑って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦 漂亮女孩快绽放笑容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ra ra ra pretty ga a ru ho ra wa ra 't te</span></p><p begin="03:45.323" end="03:48.874" itunes:key="L48">かませFIGHTINGガール胸を張って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">加油啊 战斗女孩挺起胸膛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ma se fighting ga a ru mu ne wo ha 't te</span></p><p begin="03:48.875" end="03:53.294" itunes:key="L49">甘い甘いチョコレート食べて？(よし！)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要尝尝甜甜的巧克力吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ma i a ma i cho ko re e to ta be te ？</span></p><p begin="03:53.295" end="03:56.221" itunes:key="L50">TOKYOガール芽を出して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(好)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Tokyo ga a ru me wo da shi te</span></p><p begin="03:56.222" end="03:59.864" itunes:key="L51">らららPRETTYに花咲かせよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦 让美丽花朵绽放吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ra ra ra pretty ni ha na sa ka se yo u</span></p><p begin="03:59.865" end="04:03.396" itunes:key="L52">かませFIGHTINGガール自信もって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">加油啊 战斗女孩充满自信</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ma se fighting ga a ru ji shi n mo 't te</span></p><p begin="04:03.397" end="04:27.249" itunes:key="L53">生きて生きて生きてこの場所で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">活着活着活着就在此处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki te i ki te i ki te ko no ba sho de</span></p></div></body></tt>